cepted the invitation and  something happened i dipped my toe in  the water and it just went ah  oh remember that oh that was really good  after eight years edwards started  writing again  the joy of making music returned and a  new album  emerged even amidst the coronavirus  so are you a coffee shop owner who sings  or  a singer who owns a coffee shop i am a  singer who can't go on tour  and play in a club and i'm a coffee shop  owner and i can't let people come into  my cafe  so i'm i've kind of really chosen the  two things  um professionally as a small business  entrepreneur that's you know i've really  chosen poorly for the covid crisis  [Laughter]  it's true
 

